ed on Binance alpha and futures', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'COINOTAG NEWS', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/breakingnews/bless-listed-on-binance-alpha-and-futures/', 'SOURCE_ID': 77, 'BODY': '$BLESS listed on Binance alpha and futures', 'KEYWORDS': '', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758423670, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 77, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'coinotag', 'NAME': 'CoinOtag', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/default.png', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758422429, 'CREATED_ON': 1686819961, 'UPDATED_ON': 1717748924}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 74, 'NAME': 'BNB', 'CATEGORY': 'BNB'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 25, 'NAME': 'EXCHANGE', 'CATEGORY': 'EXCHANGE'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 52038192, 'GUID': 'https://timestabloid.com/?p=83887', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1758423635, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/67/default.png', 'TITLE': 'Top 3 Most Trending Altcoins in September and Why This Rising Star Takes the Spotlight', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'PR Desk', 'URL': 'https://timestabloid.com/top-3-most-trending-altcoins-in-september-and-why-this-rising/', 'SOURCE_ID': 67, 'BODY': 'Altcoins are once again at the center of market conversations as traders look beyond Bitcoin for the next big move. September has been unusually active for digital assets, with fresh rallies, community-driven hype, and institutional interest shaping momentum. Among the top names leading the way this month are Dogecoin, XRP, and MAGACOIN FINANCE , the latter of which analysts say could deliver as much as 50x returns in this bull market cycle. Dogecoin Rides Meme Momentum and ETF Speculation Dogecoin continues to prove its staying power in the crypto landscape. Despite being launched as a meme coin, DOGE has built one of the most loyal communities in digital assets. September has brought renewed excitement, as investors speculate about the possibility of a Dogecoin exchange-traded fund (ETF) coming to U.S. markets. While still in early discussions, the mere prospect of a DOGE ETF has fueled optimism that mainstream institutions could one day have easier access to the meme coin that started it all. Trading around the mid-$0.20s, Dogecoin has shown surprising resilience. Investors are watching closely to see whether ETF speculation and community-driven campaigns can push DOGE higher in the coming weeks. With its unique blend of cultural influence and potential institutional recognition, Dogecoin remains one of the most talked-about altcoins this September. MAGACOIN FINANCE Becomes the Rising Star While Dogecoin and XRP benefit from ETF speculation and established ecosystems, MAGACOIN FINANCE is emerging as the breakout rising star of 2025 . Still in its early stages, the project has already attracted thousands of participants into its presale and continues to expand at a remarkable pace. Analysts are now projecting that MAGACOIN FINANCE could deliver up to 50x returns , echoing the kind of exponential growth seen by early adopters of DOGE and XRP in past cycles. What sets MAGACOIN FINANCE apart is its ability to capture both community energy and whale participation at the same time. Retail investors are flooding into the presale, while larger holders who previously concentrated on Bitcoin and XRP are diversifying into this new opportunity. With momentum building fast, MAGACOIN FINANCE is being tipped as one of the most promising altcoins of the cycle — not as a rival to established giants, but as a fresh vehicle for those chasing outsized returns. XRP Gains Institutional Momentum With ETF Buzz XRP has also been making significant noise this month. With its market capitalization climbing back above $180 billion, XRP recently overtook several major corporations in valuation, cementing its position as a top-tier crypto asset. The token has consistently traded above the $3 level during September, and optimism continues to grow around the pending launch of an XRP ETF in the United States. According to Bloomberg analyst James Seyffart, the long-anticipated REX-Osprey ETF is likely to receive approval soon, potentially arriving before the end of the month. Such a product would mark a historic milestone for XRP, opening the door for institutional inflows and making it easier for traditional investors to gain exposure. Ripple’s On-Demand Liquidity service, which powers global cross-border payments, already provides XRP with strong real-world use cases. Combined with the ETF narrative, many analysts see potential targets of $6 or even $13 if bullish momentum continues. Why These Altcoins Dominate September Together, Dogecoin, XRP, and MAGACOIN FINANCE reflect the different dynamics driving today’s altcoin market. Dogecoin shows the power of cultural momentum, reinforced by ETF hype that could one day bring it into the institutional spotlight. XRP combines utility with legitimacy, using Ripple’s payment network to secure real-world adoption while an ETF looms as a potential game changer for liquidity. MAGACOIN FINANCE represents the thrill of early-stage investing, where small stakes can translate into significant gains if growth continues. The common denominator is visibility. In September, each of these projects has managed to capture investor attention in a unique way, shaping narratives that extend beyond price movements alone. Conclusion Altcoins are once again leading the conversation in crypto. Dogecoin continues to ride its meme-powered momentum while investors speculate on the possibility of a DOGE ETF. XRP has captured institutional attention, with its own ETF likely to launch soon, marking a defining moment for its market. And at the same time, MAGACOIN FINANCE has emerged as the rising star , with analysts projecting as much as 50x returns for early investors. Together, these three projects highlight the range of opportunities available in the altcoin market — from cultural icons to institutional plays to breakout newcomers. To learn more about MAGACOIN FINANCE, visit: Website: https://magacoinfinance.com Access: https://magacoinfinance.com/access Twitter/X: https://x.com/magacoinfinance Telegram: https://t.me/magacoinfinance Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Times Tabloid, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. The post Top 3 Most Trending Altcoins in September and Why This Rising Star Takes the Spotlight appeared first on Times Tabloid .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Finance|News', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758423685, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 67, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'timestabloid', 'NAME': 'TimesTabloid', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/67/default.png', 'URL': 'https://timestabloid.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758422416, 'CREATED_ON': 1664381507, 'UPDATED_ON': 1673235440}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 20, 'NAME': 'DOGE', 'CATEGORY': 'DOGE'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 58, 'NAME': 'XRP', 'CATEGORY': 'XRP'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 5, 'NAME': 'ALTCOIN', 'CATEGORY': 'ALTCOIN'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 62, 'NAME': 'ZRX', 'CATEGORY': 'ZRX'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 52038160, 'GUID': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/?p=824878', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1758423615, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/21/52038160.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Dogecoin Bullish Echo: 1-2 Formation Returns As Price Breaks Key Channel', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Godspower Owie', 'URL': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/dogecoin-2/dogecoin-bullish-echo/', 'SOURCE_ID': 21, 'BODY': 'Dogecoin is once again showing signs of history repeating itself, with its well-known 1-2 formation returning on the charts. After breaking out of its key $0.22–$0.24 channel, momentum is building as bullish signals align, hinting that the meme coin may be gearing up for another powerful move. Breakout From $0.22–$0.24 Marks End Of Consolidation Alpha Crypto Signal, in a recent update, revealed a significant development for Dogecoin, noting that the meme coin has successfully broken out of its long-standing horizontal channel. This channel, which had contained its price between $0.22 and $0.24 for an extended period, had been a key consolidation zone for the asset. This decisive breach of the range confirms a major shift in momentum and signals the end of a prolonged phase of stagnant price action. Related Reading: Dogecoin On Edge — 2.5 Days Remain To Lock In Breakout Springboard The validity of this breakout is further reinforced by a crucial technical indicator: rising volume. As Dogecoin pushed higher, the increased trading volume served as a powerful signal of conviction from the buyers. This strong backing indicates that the move was not a fleeting event but rather a genuine surge of interest, with significant capital flowing into the asset. Following its strong rally, Dogecoin is currently experiencing a healthy and expected pullback from the resistance zone between $0.29 and $0.30. However, this slight retreat is a positive and natural part of a strong uptrend, as it allows the market to consolidate and prevents the rally from becoming overheated. According to the expert, this pullback is presenting a strategic opportunity for traders. Alpha Crypto Signal suggests that any retest of the breakout level, specifically the $0.24 to $0.25 zone, could offer a solid long opportunity. As long as Dogecoin can hold above this crucial zone and maintain its overall bullish structure, the positive momentum from the breakout is expected to continue. Dogecoin Pattern Repeats: History Points To Another Pump In a recent post on X, crypto analyst CryptoELlTES has revealed a compelling observation about Dogecoin’s price history. He asserts that a specific technical pattern is repeating itself on the chart, one that has consistently preceded every major Dogecoin pump in the past. This historical correlation suggests that the current setup is highly significant. Related Reading: Dogecoin Ready To Bark Again? Analyst Sees Path To $0.45 According to the analysis, Dogecoin is at the final stage of this “1-2 pattern.” The chart displays the same formation that previously launched the asset into several parabolic moves. Since the market is showing the same bullish behavior that has historically led to explosive growth for the coin, a major upward move could be on the horizon. Featured image from Pixabay, chart from Tradingview.com', 'KEYWORDS': 'Dogecoin|Alpha Crypto Signal|CryptoELLTES|doge|DOGE news|Doge price|Dogecoin news|dogecoin price|dogeusd|dogeusdt|Horizontal Channel Pattern', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758423651, 'UPDATED_ON': 1758423651, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 21, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'newsbtc', 'NAME': 'NewsBTC', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/newsbtc.png', 'URL': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1380585600, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 50, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758422399, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711620962}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCU