//resources.cryptocompare.com/news/21/52035611.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Bitcoin Tests Weekly Open As $113,300 Fair Value Gap Looms — What It Means', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Semilore Faleti', 'URL': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/news/bitcoin/bitcoin-tests-weekly-open-as-113300-fair-value-gap-looms-what-it-means/', 'SOURCE_ID': 21, 'BODY': 'Over the past week, the Bitcoin market experienced significant volatile price action, resulting in a net price loss of 0.07%. Notably, the crypto market leader initially surged to $118,000 as bullish sentiments rose after the US Federal Reserve announced the first interest rate cut of 2025. However, Bitcoin has since retraced to around $115,700 in the past 24 hours, as transaction activity cooled off. In studying the asset’s price structure, a popular market analyst with the X username KillaXBT has highlighted two important price levels. Related Reading: Countdown To ‘Bitcoin Bottom Day’: Why September 21 Could Change Everything Bitcoin’s Weekly Open Faces Pressure Amid Daily Imbalance Threat In an X post on September 19, KillaXBT shares a vital cautionary insight on the present Bitcoin market, identifying two support zones in danger. Notably, as of the latest session, BTC has retested its weekly open at $115,219, a level that has served as a key pivot point for both bulls and bears. Holding above this threshold would be a strong sign of strength, while a decisive move lower could tilt market sentiment bearish. However, there is also a heavy focus on a daily fair value gap extending down to $113,355, highlighted on the charts as an area of imbalance left behind by rapid price action. KillaXBT explains that losing the weekly open would likely trigger a price decline to $113,355 because such inefficiencies eventually get filled, as price retraces into the zone to rebalance order flow. However, there is also the presence of the previous wick low at $114,367, which currently sits just above the FVG zone. This intermediate support may act as a buffer before any deeper probe toward the $113,355 mark. According to KillaXBT, Bitcoin price holding above the weekly open and FVG price zone is critical for price action going into the next week. A successful price defence at these levels could result in a reclaim of $118,000 claim and potentially the present ATH at $124,000. Meanwhile, a decisive price fall below $113,355 would expose the premier cryptocurrency to downside targets around $112,000, $110,000, and $108,000. Related Reading: Bitcoin Cash (BCH) Plunges 6.7% As Social Media Shows Overhype Bitcoin Price Overview At the time of writing, Bitcoin is trading at $115,700, reflecting a 0.98% decline in the past day. Meanwhile, the trading volume is down by 17.14% and valued at around $35.8 billion. Despite a market cap of $2.3 trillion, Bitcoin’s dominance now stands at 57.1% indicating an ongoing outperformance by altcoins as the altseason potentially commences. Featured image from Pexels, chart from Tradingview', 'KEYWORDS': 'Bitcoin|bitcoin|Bitcoin weekly open|btc|BTCUSDT|Fair Value Gap|KillaXBT', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'NEUTRAL', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758418308, 'UPDATED_ON': 1758418309, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 21, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'newsbtc', 'NAME': 'NewsBTC', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://images.cryptocompare.com/news/default/newsbtc.png', 'URL': 'https://www.newsbtc.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': 1380585600, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 50, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758422399, 'CREATED_ON': 1657730129, 'UPDATED_ON': 1711620962}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 210, 'NAME': 'MACROECONOMICS', 'CATEGORY': 'MACROECONOMICS'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 37, 'NAME': 'MARKET', 'CATEGORY': 'MARKET'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 12, 'NAME': 'BCH', 'CATEGORY': 'BCH'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 52035651, 'GUID': 'https://en.coinotag.com/breakingnews/arthur-hayes-us-tga-nears-850b-replenishment-bitcoin-rally-set-to-resume-as-liquidity-drain-ends/', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1758418224, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/52035651.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Arthur Hayes: US TGA Nears $850B Replenishment — Bitcoin Rally Set to Resume as Liquidity Drain Ends', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'COINOTAG NEWS', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/breakingnews/arthur-hayes-us-tga-nears-850b-replenishment-bitcoin-rally-set-to-resume-as-liquidity-drain-ends/', 'SOURCE_ID': 77, 'BODY': 'TGA replenishment is drawing renewed attention after BitMEX co‑founder Arthur Hayes noted progress toward a reported $850 billion target for the United States Treasury General Account (TGA). Market participants monitor', 'KEYWORDS': 'BTC|FLOW', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758418331, 'UPDATED_ON': 1758418332, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 77, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'coinotag', 'NAME': 'CoinOtag', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/77/default.png', 'URL': 'https://en.coinotag.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758422429, 'CREATED_ON': 1686819961, 'UPDATED_ON': 1717748924}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 14, 'NAME': 'BTC', 'CATEGORY': 'BTC'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 125, 'NAME': 'FLOW', 'CATEGORY': 'FLOW'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 209, 'NAME': 'DIGITAL ASSET TREASURY', 'CATEGORY': 'DIGITAL ASSET TREASURY'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 52035687, 'GUID': 'https://en.bitcoinsistemi.com/?p=178396', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1758418220, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/81/52035687.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'XRP Blows Past Corporate Giants – Experts Eye $6 Next', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Bitcoin Sistemi', 'URL': 'https://en.bitcoinsistemi.com/xrp-blows-past-corporate-giants-experts-eye-6-next/', 'SOURCE_ID': 81, 'BODY': 'XRP has reached a historic milestone by surpassing some of the world’s largest corporations in market value. The cryptocurrency now boasts a capitalization of around $184 billion , overtaking Citigroup’s $183.6 billion valuation. It has also moved ahead of companies like Shopify and Verizon, solidifying its status as one of the top global assets. With momentum building, analysts believe XRP could push toward the $6 mark in the near term. Meanwhile, some experts note that MAGACOIN FINANCE is showing even faster growth at an earlier stage , leading many to label it one of the most promising altcoins of the current bull market. XRP’s Historic Milestone The latest rally saw XRP trade above $3.10 for the first time in weeks, delivering double-digit weekly gains. This surge has placed it among the world’s top 100 most valuable assets , ranking just below leading multinationals and financial institutions. For many observers, this moment is about more than numbers — it signals that cryptocurrency is increasingly being treated on par with established Wall Street giants. Crossing Citigroup’s market cap in particular is a symbolic achievement. Citigroup is one of the oldest and most influential banks in the United States, and for XRP to surpass its valuation demonstrates how far digital assets have come in challenging traditional finance. The fact that XRP now competes directly with corporate heavyweights for investor attention highlights the shifting balance between legacy institutions and blockchain-based alternatives. ETF Speculation Builds Momentum Much of XRP’s recent growth has been fueled by optimism around a potential XRP exchange-traded fund (ETF) . According to Bloomberg analyst James Seyffart, the REX-Osprey ETF is expected to launch as soon as next week, after a brief delay. The launch of such a product in the United States would be a landmark moment for XRP, providing investors with an easy way to gain exposure through traditional financial markets. This speculation has generated significant excitement, as ETFs often act as catalysts for new inflows from both retail and institutional players. Many analysts believe the ETF narrative is one of the primary drivers behind XRP’s push above $3 and could provide the fuel needed for further gains. XRP Faces a New Rival As XRP continues to make headlines, another name is starting to gain serious traction: MAGACOIN FINANCE . The project has quickly grown in popularity during its presale, drawing thousands of participants in just weeks. What sets it apart is its ability to scale community engagement at an impressive pace, while positioning itself as a forward-looking ecosystem rather than a one-dimensional token. Whales who have traditionally concentrated their holdings in XRP are now starting to diversify into MAGACOIN FINANCE, betting on its potential to deliver exponential growth. Analysts suggest that, at its current trajectory, MAGACOIN FINANCE could outpace XRP’s early adoption curve , establishing itself as one of the top performers in this bull cycle. Its unique mix of accessibility, innovation, and rapid momentum is why many see it as a standout altcoin for 2025. Real-World Use Strengthens XRP Beyond speculation, XRP’s real-world application has helped fuel confidence in its valuation. Ripple’s On-Demand Liquidity (ODL) service, which uses XRP as a bridge currency for cross-border payments, is being adopted by financial institutions worldwide. This distinguishes XRP from purely speculative digital assets, giving it practical utility that supports long-term investor interest. The fact that banks and payment providers are increasingly using XRP adds another layer of credibility. Investors are not just buying into a token with hype-driven potential but into an asset that is already solving billion-dollar problems in international payments. This real-world adoption is part of what makes XRP’s latest achievements sustainable rather than fleeting. A Symbolic Shift The broader significance of XRP overtaking corporations like Citigroup and Shopify is that digital assets are no longer fringe investments. They now compete directly with some of the most recognizable companies in the world. This shift underscores how investor capital is diversifying, with traditional finance and crypto increasingly intersecting. Analysts stress that for XRP to maintain its bullish trajectory, follow-up strength will be needed. Sustaining momentum after major rallies is often the key to reaching higher levels. With the ETF launch on the horizon and continued real-world use cases, XRP appears well-positioned to take the next step toward the $6 target that many experts are eyeing. Conclusion XRP’s rise to a $184 billion market cap and its climb past major corporations represent a landmark moment for the crypto industry. The coming ETF launch could provide the spark needed for further growth, while Ripple’s payment network continues to solidify XRP’s long-term value. At the same time, projects like MAGACOIN FINANCE are showing extraordinary growth potential , with some predicting it could rival the early trajectory of XRP itself. Together, these developments highlight a crypto market that is not only thriving but increasingly competing head-to-head with the giants of traditional finance. To learn more about MAGACOIN FINANCE, visit: Website: https://magacoinfinance.com Access: https://magacoinfinance.com/access Twitter/X: https://x.com/magacoinfinance Telegram: https://t.me/magacoinfinance Continue Reading: XRP Blows Past Corporate Giants – Experts Eye $6 Next', 'KEYWORDS': 'Sponsored', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 