.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Dogecoin Price Forecast for 2025: DOGE Eyes New ATH Above $1 as Mutuum Finance (MUTM) Targets 45x ROI', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Cryptopolitan Media', 'URL': 'https://www.cryptopolitan.com/for-2025-doge-eyes-new-ath-above-1-as-mutuum-finance-mutm-targets-45x-roi/', 'SOURCE_ID': 43, 'BODY': 'Dogecoin (DOGE) has long been the market’s hero because it is a meme coin and has tons of community support. Heading into Q4 2025, forecasts have DOGE establishing a New ATH above $1. In the meantime, Mutuum Finance (MUTM) is gaining serious momentum MUTM in presale Phase 6 at $0.035, which has already taken in over $16.01 million and has over 16,410 holders. The presale is structured in a manner where the token price will increase with each phase, and the listing rate is $0.06, suggesting early investors can make gigantic profits if the trend continues. While DOGE stands to recover some upside and perhaps challenge new all-time highs if everything unfolds as anticipated, Mutuum Finance is being positioned to have considerably higher upside. Dogecoin’s 2025 Outlook Dogecoin (DOGE) currently stands at $0.2685 with its price fluctuating between support at $0.22-$0.25 and resistance at $0.30. Analyst projections show DOGE going past $1 in the year 2025, with more bullish expectations pointing to it hitting $1.30-$1.50 in case sentiment, macroeconomics, or community momentum all are in its favor. Investors however envision Mutuum Finance possibly offering greater returns than DOGE’s potential in 2025. Mutuum Finance Presale Success Mutuum Finance is in presale stage 6 where it has its token available at $0.035. The campaign has been going at a very fast rate and investors have already raised more than $16.01 million. The project plans to introduce a USD-pegged stablecoin on Ethereum blockchain to retain long-term value and make payments easily. Mutuum Finance is a bi-directional DeFi lending platform of multi-purpose utility, and is favorable to both borrowers and lenders. It is manipulation-resistant and scalable and can be accessed by institutional investors as well as retail investors. Mutuum Finance (MUTM) has strong risk management measures which aim for protocol security at every instance. The protocol is strong in under-collateralized and over-lending over-collateralization liquidation. Mutuum Finance does it via cascading Loan-to-Value ratios, liquidity, liquidation fees, and reserve factors hedging and safeguarding the liquidity of the platform under any market condition. Interest rate levied by MUTM is variable and considerably lower compared to the liquidity management. One of the applications in the market is variable interest lending: available money will start lending at lower rates and a lack of liquidity will mean extra charges to support loan repayment and new deposits. It entails that the borrowers will be able to attain fixed rate lending in borrowing and at a favorable rate in comparison to the variable one and only against the very liquid collateral. Community Incentives and Growth Potential Sustained growth via staking, token buys, and scheduled exchange listings are only one of Mutuum Finance’s long-term objectives. It also has an ongoing $100,000 giveaway and guarantees to reward 10 individuals with $10,000 MUTM each. Mutuum Finance (MUTM) is soaring in presale, while Dogecoin (DOGE) is hoping to surpass $1 in 2025. While DOGE predictions are aiming for $1.30–$1.50, the presale of MUTM is already gaining huge momentum. While the tokens in Stage 6 are worth $0.035, the listing value is $0.06, giving early investors instant ROI upon launch. The project has surpassed $16.01M raised with 16,410+ holders backed by a USD-pegged stablecoin, robust lending protocol, and $100K community giveaway. With dual lending scalability, robust risk management, and institutional attractiveness, MUTM offers much more upside than DOGE’s lackluster 2025 projections. Purchase tokens immediately before the presale price in